{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >trash takeout is a score attack arcade game where trash falls from the sky and it's your job to clean it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888600/extras/e2d80155d7f2e93f2d183331275be2bc.poster.avif?t=1771779272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888600/extras/e2d80155d7f2e93f2d183331275be2bc.webm?t=1771779272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888600/extras/e2d80155d7f2e93f2d183331275be2bc.mp4?t=1771779272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are many different trash types, each with their own properties (damage, score, etc). So make sure to watch out for special ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >score as many points as possible before you die because trash that falls on you causes damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >equip modifiers that can enhance the gameplay of your future runs. you can earn modifiers by earning achievements or by doing specific tasks.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888600?t=1771779272","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888600/4889c414fa4608a7c1552ec6c51d83f68223ed1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771779272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888600/b1beae882110b5af90c1ab5b6f072f4676e6e0f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771779272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888600/b1beae882110b5af90c1ab5b6f072f4676e6e0f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771779272","categories":[{"description":"Sin